    <description>DIR-1258: Called from the Modification orchestration's final Approved stage (GCEO approval). Commits the RES_Pending_* staged values onto the 10 real tracked fields (the only point they take effect), refreshes the RES_Approved_* baseline to match, clears RES_Pending_* and the modification banner (hides it), and reactivates the plan. Since staging now happens per-field at save time (RES_Payment_Plan_Before_Save_Edit_Lock), RES_Pending_X__c is legitimately null for any field never touched during this modification cycle - the FinalValue_* formulas fall back to the field's current (already-correct, already-Approved) value in that case, rather than blindly overwriting it with null (which previously caused a REQUIRED_FIELD_MISSING failure on Name whenever a cycle didn't touch every field).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
